@@R@@
===
then we have counted only 18 pairs, and hence there were also 36 beats in 10 seconds. If we end with 19-ee, there were 18½ pairs or 37 beats in a second. It is best to count the same set of beats in one, twos and fours to realise these corrections, which are extremely @@R@@
>>>
<<<
@@R@@
===
important.

